        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oil Rubbed Bronze 24 Inch Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is 25 inches long with 24 mounting centers. The Oil Rubbed Bronze Offset 24 Inch Door Handle will fit almost any door. It is available for doors that are up to 3 inches thick in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, and back to back mounting. The Oil Rubbed Bronze 24 Inch Door Pull can be installed on wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-offset-8-inch-door-handle\"><b>8 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-offset-12-inch-door-handle\"><b>12 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-offset-36-inch-door-handle\"><b>36 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Doorware Designs RTOPULL24-613:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 25\" (640mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 24\" (610mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1\" (25mm) x 1/2\" (13mm)</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 2-5/16\" (60mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with removable rectangular rosettes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTOPULL24-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262423\"><b>DWD-RTOPULL24 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oil Rubbed Bronze Offset 24 Inch Door Handle",
                "description": "This pull is 25 inches long with 24 mounting centers. The Oil Rubbed Bronze Offset 24 Inch Door Handle will fit almost any door. It is available for doors that are up to 3 inches thick in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, and back to back mounting. The Oil Rubbed Bronze 24 Inch Door Pull can be mounted on wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal doors.",
